Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Find review (U15): one result per catechism question,
 whole-word family matches, a phone gutter on /search, a Go to field that does
 not zoom

The catechism asks five questions twice, so the index listed each twice; the build now keeps one per page. Family words (kids, mom, dad) match whole words, so "mom" no longer finds "moment". /search gains a 16px side gutter at phone width. The Go to field is 16px so a phone does not zoom on focus, and a verse the chapter on screen does not have (John 3:99) now says so instead of doing nothing. Only a rewrite that search can show replaces the server's row for it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JuCQ8kZ25i9zRwNgk6bh4e
